Blender and workspace layout
---------------------------
Betopo uses Blender's Python API and bundled modules. Blender is a separate
dependency and is not distributed in this repository or release bundle.
The workspace asset is generated from Blender's factory Modeling workspace;
the factory layout originates with the Blender project and its contributors.
Only workspace/screen layout data is saved; no user profile, personal startup
file, scene objects, or private models are bundled. The generation script is
provided in tools/build_workspace.py.
Blender license information: https://www.blender.org/about/license/

